<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight and one week rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a liquid interbank private sector market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Overnight rates were between 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent from Tuesday's 10 1/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates rose to 10 7/16 percent from 10 3/8 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
